{"seq":1,"slug":"capitalism-origins-evolution","title":"资本主义起源与演变","stage":"DONE","category":"political-economy","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 资本主义起源与演变 简介\n\n资本主义是当今世界最具影响力的经济制度，它深刻塑造了现代社会的生产方式、阶级结构和全球秩序。理解资本主义的起源与演变，是把握当代政治经济格局的基础，也是分析当前社会矛盾与制度变革的关键前提。\n\n本知识库适合对政治经济学、经济史、社会学和制度分析感兴趣的读者，尤其适合具有一定社会科学基础、希望系统了解资本主义制度逻辑及其历史变迁的学习者。无论你是经济学专业学生、社会科学研究者，还是关注当代社会问题的技术从业者，都能从中获得深入的理论视角和历史洞察。\n\n第一章**前资本主义经济形态**从封建庄园制度出发，追溯商人资本的兴起、农业革命的冲击和原工业化的萌芽，揭示资本主义诞生的多重历史条件。\n\n第二章**工业资本主义**聚焦工业革命如何催生工厂制度和城市化浪潮，古典政治经济学如何为自由市场提供理论辩护，工人运动如何回应资本的剥削，以及殖民体系如何为资本积累提供全球支撑。\n\n第三章**二十世纪资本主义**梳理福特主义大规模生产体制的兴衰、后福特主义弹性积累的崛起、嵌入式自由主义的制度设计，以及新自由主义转向的深远影响。\n\n第四章**二十一世纪资本主义**分析平台资本主义、金融化与危机、国家资本主义的回归，以及资本主义多样性的比较制度分析，连接理论与当代现实。\n\n推荐学习路径是按照章节顺序阅读。首先通过第一章建立历史感知，理解资本主义并非自然而然的制度安排；然后在第二章中把握工业化阶段的制度特征与社会冲突；接着在第三章中理解二十世纪的制度变迁逻辑；最后在第四章中将分析框架与当代现实连接起来。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pre-capitalist","title":"前资本主义经济形态","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/pre-capitalist","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feudal-economy","title":"封建经济：庄园制、农奴制与封建地租","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/pre-capitalist/feudal-economy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"merchant-capitalism","title":"商人资本：地中海贸易、汉萨同盟与远距离贸易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/pre-capitalist/merchant-capitalism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agrarian-revolution","title":"农业革命：圈地运动、农业资本主义与自由劳动力形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/pre-capitalist/agrarian-revolution"},{"seq":4,"slug":"proto-industrialization","title":"原工业化：家庭工业、Putting-out 制度与手工工场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/pre-capitalist/proto-industrialization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"industrial-capitalism","title":"工业资本主义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/industrial-capitalism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-revolution","title":"工业革命：技术革新、工厂制度与城市化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/industrial-capitalism/industrial-revolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-political-economy","title":"古典政治经济学：斯密、李嘉图与自由放任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/industrial-capitalism/classical-political-economy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"labor-movement","title":"工人运动：工会、宪章运动与国际工人协会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/industrial-capitalism/labor-movement"},{"seq":4,"slug":"colonialism-capitalism","title":"殖民主义与资本：原始积累、种植园经济与帝国主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/industrial-capitalism/colonialism-capitalism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"20th-century-capitalism","title":"二十世纪资本主义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/20th-century-capitalism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fordism","title":"福特主义：大规模生产、凯恩斯主义与福利国家","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/20th-century-capitalism/fordism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"post-fordism","title":"后福特主义：弹性生产、全球价值链与去工业化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/20th-century-capitalism/post-fordism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"embedded-liberalism","title":"嵌入式自由主义：布雷顿森林、金融管制与社会契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/20th-century-capitalism/embedded-liberalism"},{"seq":4,"slug":"neoliberal-turn","title":"新自由主义转向：撒切尔、里根与金融自由化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/20th-century-capitalism/neoliberal-turn"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"21st-century-capitalism","title":"二十一世纪资本主义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/21st-century-ca